WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.700
An Agnes session that runs in Orca.

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.800
You type the request in the chat.

3
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:14.000
Agnes opens a new Orca terminal with Claude Code.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Claude Code runs it on your computer.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:29.800
